# Screenshots of the *authenticated* Linear app.
#
# The visual-research lane found the browser already signed in to a real
# workspace, so its highest-fidelity references are captures of live company
# issues — issue titles, and in the detail view the full names of three
# people. Everything measured from them (the palette, the glyph geometry, the
# layout constants) lives on in `research/01-visual-design.md` and in the
# sanitised dumps under `research/extracted/`, which is the part worth keeping.
#
# The dumps were sanitised rather than deleted: identifiers were replaced with
# neutral placeholders and all 511 measured token values kept. A screenshot
# cannot be sanitised that way, so these two stay local.
research/screenshots/linear-app-*

